# Bot1 Lightning Bolts its own Ornithopter on turn 1 (a creature card and an instant in its graveyard). Two Ghost Vacuums: the first exiles the Ornithopter on turn 3 and the Bolt on turn 5. On turn 7 the second Vacuum is released
# with nothing exiled with it: it is sacrificed and nothing returns (the first one's cards are not its). On turn 9 the first Vacuum's {6}, {T}, sacrifice ability is sorcery speed: refused in the beginning of combat with everything
# untapped, done in main phase 2, returning the Ornithopter as a 1/1 Spirit with a flying counter and leaving the Bolt, which is not a creature, in exile.

